// tasks.csv — append-only, last-write-wins by id
// Schema: id,status,title,due_ts,chg_ts,category,tags,importance
// 
// due_ts: Unix timestamp (seconds since epoch, local time). Date-only entries
//   are stored at 12:00 noon of the due day, never midnight — e.g. "2026-09-13"
//   is written as 1789290000. Enter dates via taskupdate.py; it converts.
// chg_ts: Unix timestamp of the last change to the task.
// 
// category: single primary bucket (work|personal|house|learning|admin)
// tags: comma-separated cross-cutting tags (oncall,blocking,someday,critical,emergency,migration,meeting,review,health,hobby,social,project)
// importance: low|medium|high (impact rating, not used for filtering)
// 
// Global tags (always active):
//   always_show: critical, emergency — bypasses context filter
//   never_show: cancelled, archived — always excluded

